partcad-collection-openusd-apple
================================

This PartCAD package serves Apple's AR Quick Look gallery as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `apple_repo.py` repository plugin, the shared
`usd_assets.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No asset is included in this repository. The assets, their layers and their
textures are fetched on demand from https://developer.apple.com/quick-look-gallery/,
and remain Apple's, under the terms of Apple's site
(https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/terms/site.html), which let nobody
mirror them; the plugin fetches a model for the person who asked for it.

Apple, AR Quick Look and the models' brands are trademarks of their owners.
This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple.
